#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The Syslog tables are not partitioned.  Traditional (non-partitioned) tables are deprecated, and partitioned tables are required for new installs.  Your data will continue to be collected, but you should migrate the syslog table to a partitioned architecture."
msgstr "Shaxda Syslog lama qaybin. Shaxda dhaqameed (aan la qaybin) waa la joojiyay, waxaana loo baahan yahay shax qaybsan rakibaadaha cusub. Xogtaadu way sii socon doontaa in la ururiyo, laakiin waa inaad u guurtaa shaxda syslog qaab-dhismeed qaybsan."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Waiting for a completed processing run."
msgstr "Waxaa la sugayaa socodsiin hawleed oo dhammaystiran."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Processing is completing within the allowed delay."
msgstr "Habayntu waxay ku dhammaanaysaa muddada dib u dhaca ee la oggol yahay gudaheeda."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "No processing run has completed for more than %d seconds."
msgstr "Wax orod habayn ah ma dhammaystirmin in ka badan %d ilbiriqsi."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Incoming messages are within the configured limits."
msgstr "Fariimaha soo galaya waxay ku jiraan xadka la habeeyay."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Incoming queue metrics are unavailable."
msgstr "Cabiraadaha safka soo galaya lama heli karo."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Incoming backlog of at least %s messages exceeds the limit of %s."
msgstr "Culayska fariimaha soo galaya oo gaaraya ugu yaraan %s wuxuu dhaafay xadka %s."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The oldest incoming message timestamp is unavailable."
msgstr "Waqtiga fariinta soo galaysa ee ugu da'da weyn lama heli karo."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unprocessed messages are older than %d seconds."
msgstr "Fariimaha aan la habayn waxay ka weyn yihiin %d ilbiriqsi."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Synchronization is not enabled on this collector."
msgstr "Isku-duwidda lagama hawlgelin ururiyahan."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Synchronization is within the allowed delay."
msgstr "Isku-duwidda waxay ku jirtaa xadka dib-u-dhaca la oggol yahay."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Synchronization queue metrics are unavailable."
msgstr "Halbeegyada safka isku-duwidda lama heli karo."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The oldest synchronization record timestamp is unavailable."
msgstr "Waqtiga diiwaanka iswaafajinta ee ugu da'da weyn lama heli karo."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Synchronization has failed or queued records exceed the allowed delay."
msgstr "Isku-duwidda way fashilantay ama diiwaannada safka ku jira waxay dhaafeen dib-u-dhaca la oggol yahay."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Partition maintenance is not blocked."
msgstr "Dayactirka qaybinta lama xannibin."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Partition maintenance is blocked: %s"
msgstr "Dayactirka qaybinta waa la xannibay: %s"

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog pipeline health - collector %d"
msgstr "Caafimaadka dhuunta Syslog - ururiyaha %d"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The Syslog pipeline has recovered."
msgstr "Dhuunta Syslog way soo kabsatay."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Partition layout for %s is invalid or incomplete; partition maintenance stopped. Verify the partition metadata with SHOW CREATE TABLE and, if required, rebuild the partitions; writes continue into the dMaxValue safety partition."
msgstr "Qaabka qaybinta ee %s waa mid aan sax ahayn ama aan dhammaystirnayn; dayactirka qaybinta waa la joojiyay. Ku hubi xogta hoose ee qaybinta adigoo adeegsanaya SHOW CREATE TABLE oo, haddii loo baahdo, dib u dhis qaybaha; qoristu waxay ku sii socotaa qaybta badbaadada ee dMaxValue."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "remaining partition gap: %d partition(s)"
msgstr "farqiga qaybta haray: %d qayb(ood)"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "no retention deferral"
msgstr "dib-u-dhigis hayn ma jirto"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "retention pruning deferred until the future horizon is restored"
msgstr "nadiifinta haynta dib ayaa loo dhigay ilaa laga soo celiyo aragtida mustaqbalka"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "new records are accumulating in the dMaxValue safety partition"
msgstr "diiwaanno cusub ayaa ku ururaya qaybta badbaadada ee dMaxValue"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "per run recovery limit reached"
msgstr "xadka soo kabashada ee orodkiiba waa la gaaray"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "partition creation failed"
msgstr "abuurista qaybta waa ku guuldarraysatay"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Unknown partitioning level; choose Hourly or Daily."
msgstr "Heerka qaybinta aan la aqoon; dooro Saacadle ama Maalinle."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The Syslog retention is invalid."
msgstr "Haynta Syslog ma aha mid sax ah."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Hourly partitioning cannot be used with Indefinite retention, which would need an unbounded number of partitions. Choose a retention period or Daily partitioning."
msgstr "Qaybinta saacad kasta lama isticmaali karo haynta aan xadidnayn, taas oo u baahan doonta tiro qaybo ah oo aan xad lahayn. Dooro muddo hayn ah ama qaybinta maalinlaha ah."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s partitioning with %s days of retention and a %s day pre-create window needs %s partitions per table, which exceeds this database server's limit of %s partitions. Reduce the retention, shorten the pre-create window, or choose Daily partitioning."
msgstr "Qaybinta %s oo leh %s maalmood oo hayn ah iyo daaqad abuuris-hore oo %s maalmood ah waxay u baahan tahay %s qaybood miiskiiba, taas oo dhaaftay xadka server-ka xogta ee ah %s qaybood. Yaree haynta, soo gaabi daaqadda abuuris-hore, ama dooro qaybinta Maalinlaha ah."

