#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Syslog Upgrade Advisor"
msgstr "La-taliyaha Casriyeynta Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade Syslog from %s to %s? Existing messages and rules will be preserved. Schema changes may take time."
msgstr "Ma u cusbooneysiisaa Syslog laga bilaabo %s ilaa %s? Farriimaha iyo xeerarka jira waa la ilaalin doonaa. Isbeddellada qaab-dhismeedka xogtu waxay qaadan karaan waqti."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What upgrade/install type do you wish to use"
msgstr "Noocee ah cusbooneysiin/rakibid ayaad rabtaa inaad isticmaasho"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When you have very large tables, performing a Truncate will be much quicker.  If you are concerned about archive data, you can choose either Inline, which will freeze your browser for the period of this upgrade, or background, which will create a background process to bring your old syslog data from a backup table to the new syslog format.  Again this process can take several hours.  A Truncate discards the stored syslog and removed messages only; alert, removal and report rules are always kept."
msgstr "Marka aad haysato miisas aad u waaweyn, samaynta Truncate way ka dhakhso badnaan doontaa. Haddii aad ka welwelsan tahay xogta kaydka ah, waxaad dooran kartaa midkood Inline, taas oo barafoobin doonta biraawsarkaaga muddada cusboonaysiintan, ama gadaal (background), taas oo abuuri doonta hab gadaal ah si ay u keento xogtaada syslog ee duugga ah miiska kaydka una beddesho qaabka cusub ee syslog. Mar labaad habkani wuxuu qaadan karaa dhowr saacadood. Truncate wuxuu tuuraa oo keliya syslog-ga la keydiyay iyo farriimaha la saaray; xeerarka digniinta, saarista iyo warbixinta had iyo jeer waa la hayaa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Truncate Syslog Table"
msgstr "Faaruqi Jadwalka Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Inline Upgrade"
msgstr "Casriyayn Toos ah"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Background Upgrade"
msgstr "Cusboonaysiinta Gadaasha"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Database Storage Engine"
msgstr "Mishiinka Kaydinta ee Kaydka Xogta"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The storage engine for the analytical tables.  Only InnoDB and, on MariaDB, Aria storage engines are supported.  Any Remote Data Collector option requires InnoDB; incompatible combinations cannot be submitted."
msgstr "Mashiinka kaydinta ee miisaska falanqaynta.  Kaliya InnoDB iyo, MariaDB dhexdeeda, mashiinnada kaydinta Aria ayaa la taageeraa.  Doorasho kasta oo Xog-uruuriye Fog ah waxay u baahan tahay InnoDB; isku-dhafyada aan is-waafaqsanayn lama gudbin karo."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "InnoDB Storage"
msgstr "Kaydinta InnoDB"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria Storage"
msgstr "Kaydinta Aria"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Saxnaanta Calaamad-waqtiga"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Saxnaanta millisekondhigu waxay kaydisaa waqti-calaamadaha syslog ee ka yar ilbiriqsiga gudaha tiirka TIMESTAMP(3), waxayna diyaar u tahay oo keliya MariaDB. Saxnaanta ilbiriqsigu waxay isticmaashaa tiirka TIMESTAMP ee caadiga ah. Nidaam shaqaynaya dushiisa, isticmaal cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms inta lagu jiro waqtiga dayactirka si aad u beddesho farriimaha jira adigoon tuurin."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "Millisekondhi - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB keliya)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Ilbiriqsi - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Habaynta Farriimaha Fog"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Habaynta Farriimaha Ururiyaha Xogta Fog"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Haddii Ururiyayaasha Xogta Fog ay leeyihiin xog-kaydiyayaal Syslog oo u gaar ah oo ay si madax-bannaan u habeeyaan farriimahooda, calaamadee sanduuqan. Adigoo calaamadaynaya Sanduuqan, Ururiyayaasha Xogta Fog waxay u baahan doonaan inay ilaashadaan faylkooda u gaarka ah ee 'config_local.php' si ay ugu sheegaan Syslog inuu adeegsado xog-kaydiye madax-bannaan oo loogu talagalay muujinta iyo habaynta farriimaha. Fadlan u isticmaal faylka Qaab-dhismeedka 'config_local.php.dist' ujeeddadan. DIGNIIN: Shaxda Syslog si toos ah ayaa loo abuuri doonaa isla marka ikhtiyaarkan La hawlgeliyo."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Isku-dubbaridka Xeerarka Xog-uruuriyaha Fog"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Haddii Ururiyayaasha Xogta Fog ay leeyihiin xog-kaydiyayaal Syslog oo u gaar ah oo ay si madax-bannaan u habeeyaan farriimahooda, calaamadee sanduuqan haddii aad rabto in xeerarka Qaylo-dhaanta, Ka-saaridda iyo Warbixinta ee xog-kaydiyaha weyn ee Cacti loo diro Nidaamka Fog ee Cacti."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Ku kaydi Diiwaannada Xog-uruuriyaha Fog"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Ku hay fariimaha la habeeyay shaxda syslog ee uruuriyaha fog ka dib marka loo geeyo Uruuriyaha Guud. Marka la joojiyo, diiwaannada waxaa lagu hayaa gudaha oo keliya inta Uruuriyaha Guud aan la heli karin waana la saaraa ka dib marka la xaqiijiyo gaarsiinta soo kabashada."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Siyaasadda Kaydinta"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Dooro inta maalmood ee qiimaha Syslog aad rabto in aad ku hayso xog-kaydka."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Heerka Qaybinta"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Cabbirka qayb kasta oo ka mid ah miisaska syslog iyo syslog_removed.  Maalinle ayaa lagula talinayaa.  Saacadle wuxuu u baahan yahay hayn xaddidan, haynta iyo heerka qaybinta oo wada jirana waa inay ku habboonaadaan xadka qaybinta ee server-ka kaydka xogta.  Si aad hadhow u beddesho heerka, ka beddel Dejinta oo socodsii cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Cusboonaysii"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Rakib"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "La-taliyaha %s ee Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "DIGNIIN: Cusboonaysiinta Syslog waxay qaadataa waqti badan!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Cusboonaysiinta shaxda 'main' ee Syslog waxay noqon kartaa hanaan qaata waqti aad u dheer. Sidaa darteed, waxaa lagugula talinayaa inaad yarayso cabbirka shaxdaada Syslog ka hor intaadan cusboonaysiin, ama aad doorato ikhtiyaarka gadaal ka shaqaynta (background)."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Haddii aad doorato ikhtiyaarka gadaal (background), shaxdaada hore ee Syslog magaceeda waa la beddeli doonaa, waxaana la abuuri doonaa shax cusub oo Syslog ah. Kadib, habka cusboonaysiinta ayaa laga bilaabi doonaa gadaal. Mar kale, habkan gadaal ka socda wuxuu qaadan karaa waqti badan inuu dhammaado. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, xogtaada waa la ilaalin doonaa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Iyadoon loo eegin doorashadaada, dhammaan xeerarka ka-saarista iyo digniinta ee jira waa la ilaalin doonaa inta lagu jiro habka cusbooneysiinta."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Riix <b>'Cusboonaysii'</b> si aad u sii waddo casriyeynta, ama <b>'Jooji'</b> si aad ugu laabato liiska Kordhinnada."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "Waxaad sidoo kale dejin kartaa matoorka kaydinta kaydka xogta ee miisaska falanqaynta syslog iyo syslog_remove. Kaliya matoorka kaydinta InnoDB iyo, MariaDB, matoorka kaydinta Aria ayaa la taageeraa. Haddii aad isticmaalayso MariaDB, waxaan kugula talinaynaa Matoorka Kaydinta Aria marka aan la hawlgelin dookhyada Ururiyaha Xogta Fog; dookhyada ururiyuhu waxay u baahan yihiin InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "Waxaad leedahay dhowr ikhtiyaar oo aad kala dooran karto marka aad rakibayso Syslog.  Midda koowaad waa Qaab-dhismeedka Xog-kaydka.  Shaxaha la qaybiyay waa qaab-dhismeedka keliya ee la taageero maadaama ay ka hortagaan in cabbirka shaxuhu uu xad-dhaaf noqdo taas oo gaabinaysa weydiimaha.  Shaxaha dhaqameed ee aan la qaybin waa kuwo laga guuray oo aan hadda loo bixin rakibaadaha cusub."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa saxnaanta waqti-calaamadeynta. Saxnaanta milliseken (TIMESTAMP(3)) waxay ilaalisaa kala horraynta ka yar ilbiriqsiga ee farriimaha soo gelaya waxaana laga heli karaa oo keliya MariaDB; rakibaadaha MySQL waxay isticmaalaan saxnaanta ilbiriqsiga. Tan lagama beddeli karo isla goobta dambe iyadoo aan la burburin farriimaha la keydiyay."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Kaydinta Aria lama heli karo iyadoo ikhtiyaar kasta oo Ururiyaha Xogta Fog uu la hawlgeliyay yahay. InnoDB ayaa la doortay."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa muddada haynta. Fadlan maskaxda ku hay in haddii aad leedahay dhowr martigeliye oo ku diiwaangelinaya syslog, miiskani wuxuu noqon karaa mid aad u weyn."

