#: includes/settings.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Guud"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog La hawlgeliyay"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, records will be transferred from the Syslog Incoming table to the main syslog table and Alerts and Reports will be enabled.  Please keep in mind that if the system is disabled log entries will still accumulate into the Syslog Incoming table as this is defined by the rsyslog or syslog-ng process."
msgstr "Haddii sanduuqan la calaamadeeyo, diiwaannada waxaa laga wareejin doonaa shaxda Syslog-ga Soo Galaya loona wareejin doonaa shaxda weyn ee Syslog, Qaylo-dhaannada iyo Warbixinnadana waa La hawlgeliyay. Fadlan maskaxda ku hay in haddii nidaamku yahay mid La joojiyay, qoraallada diiwaanka (log) ay weli ku ururi doonaan shaxda Syslog-ga Soo Galaya maadaama tan ay qeexayso habka rsyslog ama syslog-ng."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Forward alarms to Alarm Manager"
msgstr "U gudbi digniinnada Maamulaha Digniinnada"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "U oggolow xeerarka loo dejiyay Maareeyaha Alaarmiga inay gudbiyaan alaarmiyada. Iimaylka Syslog wuxuu ahaanayaa kaydka dambe; ficillada amarku waxay u shaqeeyaan oo keliya xeerarka Digniinta Syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Ka saar Magacyada Domain-ka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "Liis goobaha (domains) ah oo koomo lagu kala saaray oo aad rabto inaad ka saarto magaca martigeliyaha syslog, Tusaalooyinku waxay noqon karaan 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Muddada Cusboonaysiinta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Kani waa wakhtiga ilbiriqsiyada ah ka hor inta uusan boggu dib isu cusboonaysiin."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Ka bood tirinta guud ee safafka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Haddii sanduuqan la calaamadeeyo, qaybaha Diiwaannada Nidaamka iyo Diiwaannada Qaylo-dhaanta ma tiriyaan diiwaan kasta oo u dhigma, taas oo aad qaali ugu noqon karta rakibaadaha waaweyn. Boggu wuxuu muujinayaa xiriiriyayaasha Hore iyo Xiga halkii uu ka muujin lahaa wadarta iyo liiska bogagga, waxaana la bixiyaa Xiga inta ay diiwaanno kale harsan yihiin."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Diiwaannada Warbixinta ee Ugu Badan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Digniinnada ku saleysan Xadka, waa maxay tirada ugu badan ee aad rabto in lagu muujiyo warbixinta.  Tani waxaa loo adeegsadaa in lagu xaddido cabbirka diiwaanka html iyo Iimayl-ka."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "%d Diiwaanno"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Hababka Ugu Badan ee Ka-shaqaynta Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Marka laga dhigo wax ka badan 1, habaynta farriimaha soo gelaya waxaa loo qaybiyaa habab shaqaale oo is barbar socda. Shaqaale kastaa wuxuu maamulaa tiro kala go'an oo farriimaha soo gelaya ah, taasoo dedejinaysa xallinta magaca martigeliyaha iyo wareejinta farriimaha xilliyada culayska culus. Dejinta 1 waxay ku habaysaa dhammaan farriimaha hal hab. Hababka shaqaalaha laguma taageero Windows ama marka kordhinta PHP pcntl iyo POSIX aan la heli karin, markaas oo habayntu dib ugu noqoto hal hab."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "%d Hawl Shaqaale"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "%d Hawlo Shaqaale"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Amarka Furitaanka Tigidhada"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "Amarkan waxaa loo fulin doonaa furitaanka Tigidhada Xafiiska Caawinta. Amarka waxaa looga baahan doonaa inuu falanqeeyo halbeegyo gelin oo badan sida soo socota: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>. Liiska martigeliyeyaashu wuxuu noqon doonaa liis hakad lagu kala saaray oo martigeliyeyaal ah oo digniintu saamaysay."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Helidda Martigeliyaha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Xallinta Magaca Martigeliyaha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Haddii sanduuqan la calaamadeeyo, dhammaan magacyada martigeliyayaasha waxaa marka hore lagu xallinayaa raadinta DNS (Haddii la hawlgeliyay), iyadoo la adeegsanayo diiwaannada A iyo AAAA. Cinwaannada IPv4 iyo IPv6 uma baahna raadin, cinwaannada IPv6-na waxaa lagu kaydiyaa qaab yar oo la isku soo koobay. Haddii raadinta DNS ay fashilanto, nidaamku wuxuu isku dayi doonaa inuu magaca martigeliyaha ka xalliyo shaxda Martigeliye ee Cacti oo uu ku beddelo sharraxaadda Martigeliye ee Cacti. Haddii labada raadin ee DNS iyo Cacti ay fashilmaan, diiwaannada waxaa la siiyaa horgalaha 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Ka bood xallinta DNS ee martigeliyeyaasha soo gelaya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Haddii sanduuqan la calaamadeeyo, nidaamku isku dayi maayo inuu martigeliyayaasha ku xalliyo raadinta DNS. Tani waxay faa'iido u leedahay deegaannada aanay suurtogal ka ahayn ama aan laga rabin xallinta DNS."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Ogeysiiska HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Iimaylka ku salaysan HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Haddii sanduuqan la calaamadeeyo, dhammaan Iimayllada waxaa lagu diri doonaa qaab HTML ah. Haddii kale, Iimayllada waxaa lagu diri doonaa qoraal cad."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Faylka Qaabaynta ee la Adeegsanayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Dooro faylka duubaha html-ka gaarka ah iyo CSS ee la adeegsanayo. Faylkani wuxuu ka kooban yahay html iyo CSS si uu u duubo warbixintaada. Haddii uu ka kooban yahay wax ka badan CSS oo keliya, waxaad u baahan tahay inaad faylka dhexdiisa geliso summad gaar ah oo <REPORT> ah. Summaddan qaabaynta waxaa lagu beddeli doonaa waxa ku jira warbixinta. Faylashani waxay ku yaallaan galka 'formats'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Haynta Xogta iyo Qaybinta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Haynta Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Tani waa tirada maalmaha lagu haynayo dhacdooyinka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Cabbirka qayb kasta oo ka mid ah miisaska syslog iyo syslog_removed. Isbeddelka halkan ayaa lagu keydiyaa laakiin wuxuu dhaqan galaa oo keliya marka cli/upgrade_partitioning.php uu dib u dhiso labada miis; ilaa markaas, dayactirka qaybintu wuxuu ilaaliyaa cabbirka jira. Qaybinta saacadle ah waxay u baahan tahay hayn xaddidan. Haynta, daaqadda horay-u-abuurista iyo heerka qaybinta oo wada jira waa inay ku habboonaadaan xadka qaybinta ee server-ka kaydka xogta, haddii kale dejinta lama keydin doono."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Daaqadda Hore-u-abuurista Qaybinta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Tani waa tirada maalmaha qaybaha mustaqbalka ee loo haynayo miisaska Syslog ee la qaybiyay, si qaybaha cusub mar walba looga kala gooyo qaybta dMaxValue ee madhan. Qaybinta saacadle ah waxay mar walba haysaa ugu yaraan 2 maalmood."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "%d Maalin"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "%d Maalmood"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Xadka Soo-kabashada Qaybinta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Marka qaybo ay maqan yihiin (tusaale ahaan ka dib hakad dayactir), ugu badnaan tiradan qaybaha maqan miiskiiba waxaa la abuuraa orod kasta oo Xog-uruuriye. Farqiga haray wuxuu ku bogsadaa orodyada xiga; jarista haynta waxay ahaanaysaa mid dib loo dhigo ilaa jihooyinka qaybaha mustaqbalka si buuxda loo soo celiyo. Waxay khusaysaa oo keliya miisaska Syslog ee la qaybiyay."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partition per run"
msgstr "%d Qayb hawlgalkiiba"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partitions per run"
msgstr "%d Qaybood hawlgalkiiba"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Staleness Threshold"
msgstr "Xadka Gabowga Xogta ee Ururiyaha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline health alerts warn when unprocessed messages, processing completion, or queued synchronization exceed this delay. The effective delay is at least three poller intervals and 300 seconds. Set to 0 to use 300 seconds."
