#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Alerts"
msgstr "Qaylo-dhaanta Caafimaadka Dhuunta Xogta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Notification List"
msgstr "Liiska Ogeysiiska Caafimaadka Dhuunta Xogta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Dooro liiska ogeysiiska Thold ee jira si loogu helo digniinaha caafimaadka dhuunta xogta. Qaatayaasha liiska La hawlgeliyay waxaa lagu daraa cinwaannada iimaylka ee hoose, iyadoo la ilaalinayo qaatayaasha BCC. Liisasku waxay u baahan yihiin shaxda liiska-ogeysiiska ee Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Qaatayaasha Iimaylka Caafimaadka Dhuunta Xogta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Qaataha iimaylka ee kooma lagu kala soocay ee fashilka iyo soo kabashada dhuunta xogta. Bannaanka u daa oo ha dooran wax liis ogeysiis ah si aad u joojiso iimaylka; caafimaadku wuxuu ku sii muuqanayaa tabka Xaaladda isbeddellada xaaladdana waa la diiwaangelinayaa. Hubintu waxay u baahan tahay in xog-uruuriyaha Cacti uu shaqeeyo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Muddada Xusuusinta Caafimaadka Dhuunta Xogta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Ku celi ogeysiisyada dhibaatooyinka dhuumaha xogta ee socda muddadan ka dib. Isku dayga iimaylka ee fashilmay dib looma dayo wax ka badan hal mar shantii daqiiqoba."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
msgstr "Haynta Digniinaha Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep alert logs."
msgstr "Tani waa tirada maalmaha lagu haynayo diiwaannada qaylo-dhaanta."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Suppression and Maintenance"
msgstr "Xakamaynta Feejignaanta iyo Dayactirka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Days"
msgstr "Maalmaha Daaqadda Dayactirka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Days when all alert notifications are muted during the configured maintenance timeframe."
msgstr "Maalmaha dhammaan ogeysiisyada digniinta la aamusiyo inta lagu jiro muddada dayactirka ee la habeeyay."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Starts"
msgstr "Bilowga Daaqadda Dayactirka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local start time for the global maintenance window."
msgstr "Waqtiga bilowga maxalliga ah ee daaqadda dayactirka guud."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Ends"
msgstr "Dhammaadka Daaqadda Dayactirka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local end time for the global maintenance window. An earlier end time continues into the next day."
msgstr "Waqtiga dhammaadka maxalliga ah ee daaqadda dayactirka guud. Waqti dhammaad oo ka horreeya wuxuu u gudbaa maalinta xigta."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Starts"
msgstr "Dayactirka Hal-mar ah wuxuu Bilaabanayaa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to start a one-time global maintenance window."
msgstr "Taariikhda iyo waqtiga maxalliga ah ee ikhtiyaariga ah si loo bilaabo daaqadda dayactirka guud ee hal-mar ah."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Ends"
msgstr "Dayactirka Hal-mar ah wuxuu Dhammaanayaa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to end a one-time global maintenance window. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."
msgstr "Taariikhda iyo waqtiga maxalliga ah ee ikhtiyaariga ah si loo dhammeeyo daaqadda dayactirka guud ee hal-mar ah. Qaabka: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Alert Cooldown"
msgstr "Muddada Nasashada Digniinta ee Caadiga ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress any repeat notification for the same rule and reporting scope for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Jooji ogeysiis kasta oo soo noqnoqda oo isku xeer iyo baaxad warbixin ah intan oo daqiiqo. Qiimayaasha xeer kasta ayaa ka sarreeya dejintan. U deji 0 si aad u joojiso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Duplicate Suppression"
msgstr "Xakamaynta Nuqullada ee Caadiga ah"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress a notification with the same matched message set for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Jooji ogeysiis leh fariin isku mid ah oo la waafajiyay intan oo daqiiqo. Qiimayaasha xeer kasta ayaa ka sarreeya dejintan. U deji 0 si aad u joojiso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Syslog Recovery"
msgstr "Soo-celinta Syslog Fog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Recovery Records Per Execution"
msgstr "Diiwaannada Soo-kabashada ee Ugu Badan Fulintii Kasta"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of retained remote Syslog events sent to the Main Collector by one recovery worker execution. Each central database transaction remains capped at 100 records. Increase gradually while observing Main Collector load and lock waits."
msgstr "Tirada ugu badan ee dhacdooyinka Syslog ee fog ee la hayo ee loo diro Ururiyaha Guud hal fulin oo shaqaalaha soo-kabashada ah. Hawlgal kasta oo keydka xogta dhexe ah wuxuu ku kooban yahay 100 diiwaan. Si tartiib tartiib ah u kordhi adigoo eegaya culayska Ururiyaha Guud iyo sugitaanka xiritaanka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Recovery Pause Between Batches"
msgstr "Hakadka Soo-kabashada ee U Dhexeeya Kooxaha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pause between each 100-record Main Collector delivery transaction. A longer pause lowers Main Collector pressure; a shorter pause speeds backlog convergence."
msgstr "Haki inta u dhaxaysa mid kasta oo ka mid ah 100-diiwaan ee wax-is-dhaafsiga gaarsiinta Ururiyaha Weyn. Hakad dheer wuxuu yareeyaa cadaadiska Ururiyaha Weyn; hakad gaaban wuxuu dedejiyaa dhammaystirka hawlaha ururay."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "No pause"
msgstr "Hakin la'aan"

