msgstr "Fadlan geli liis ciwaannada Iimaylka ah oo koomo lagu kala soocay si loo ogeysiiyo.  Haddii aad rabto inaad Iimayl ugu dirto qof qaab SMS ah, fadlan ku billow ciwaanka Iimaylka ee qofkaas <b>'sms@'</b>.  Tusaale ahaan, haddii ciwaanka SMS-ka ee qaatahu yahay <b>'2485551212@mycarrier.net'</b>, waxaad u gelinaysaa sidatan <b>'sms@2485551212@mycarrier.net'</b> waxaana loo qaabayn doonaa sidii farriin SMS ah."

