msgstr "Fur Tigidh"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Should a Help Desk Ticket be opened for this Alert.  NOTE: The Ticket command script will be populated with several 'ALERT_' environment variables for convenience."
msgstr "Ma in Tigidhka Caawinta loo furo Digniintan.  FG: Qoraalka amarka Tigidhka waxaa lagu buuxin doonaa dhowr doorsoome deegaan oo 'ALERT_' ah si loogu fududeeyo."

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Alert command"
msgstr "Amarka feejignaanta"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "When an Alert is triggered, run the following command.  The following replacement variables are available <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>.  Please note that <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> is only available on individual thresholds.  These replacement values can appear on the command line, or be gathered from the environment of the script.  When used from the environment, those variables will be prefixed with 'ALERT_'."
msgstr "Marka Digniin la kiciyo, socodsii amarkan soo socda. Doorsoomayaasha beddelka ee soo socda ayaa la heli karaa <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>. Fadlan ogow in <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> uu ku jiro oo keliya xadadka gaarka ah. Qiimayaashan beddelka ahi waxay ka soo muuqan karaan khadka taliska, ama waxaa laga soo ururin karaa deegaanka qoraalka. Marka laga isticmaalo deegaanka, doorsoomayaashaas waxaa laga hormarin doonaa 'ALERT_'."

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Recovery command"
msgstr "Amarka soo-kabashada"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Optional command to run when this threshold recovers after its quiet period. Uses the same replacement variables as Alert command. SYSLOG_EVENT is clear; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID matches the breach command. Failed commands are retried. Leave blank to disable."
msgstr "Amar ikhtiyaari ah oo la socodsiinayo marka xadkani soo kabto kaddib xilligiisa degganaanshaha. Wuxuu adeegsadaa isla doorsoomayaasha beddelka ee amarka Digniinta. SYSLOG_EVENT wuu cad yahay; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID wuxuu la mid yahay amarka jebinta. Amarrada fashilma dib ayaa loo isku dayaa. Bannaanka u daa si aad u joojiso."

