#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message code to look for, for example %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN or 4625. It must equal a whole word of the syslog message (letters, digits and _ . - /); a leading % is literal and must match as written. The match is not case sensitive. See How Recommendations Are Matched on the list page."
msgstr "Koodhka fariinta ee la raadinayo, tusaale ahaan %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN ama 4625. Waa inuu la mid noqdaa erey buuxa oo ka mid ah fariinta syslog (xarfaha, lambarada iyo _ . - /); % hore waa mid dhab ah waana inuu u dhigmaa sida loo qoray. Iswaafajintu ma tixgeliso xarfaha waaweyn iyo kuwa yaryar. Eeg Sida Talooyinka Loo Iswaafajiyo bogga liiska."

