#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A lightbulb before the message marks matching recommendations on the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs. Click the message to read them in the details flyout. Hovering never requests the server."
msgstr "Nalka yar ee ka horreeya farriinta wuxuu calaamadeeyaa talooyinka u dhigma ee ku jira tabaha Diiwaanka Nidaamka iyo Diiwaanka Digniinaha. Guji farriinta si aad ugu akhrido daaqadda faahfaahinta. Dul-maridda weligeed codsi uma dirto server-ka."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Only the <b>Identifier</b> column is used for matching. The vendor, component, severity, message and explanation are shown in the details flyout but are never searched."
msgstr "Kaliya tiirka <b>Aqoonsiga</b> ayaa loo adeegsadaa iswaafajinta. Soo-saaraha, qaybta, darnaanta, farriinta iyo sharraxaadda waxaa lagu muujiyaa daaqadda faahfaahinta laakiin waligood lama baaro."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The first 2,048 characters of the message are split into words. A word is a run of letters, digits and the characters _ . - / that may start with %. Every other character, such as a space, colon, comma or bracket, ends a word. In <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> the words are <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> and <code>down</code>."
msgstr "2,048-da xaraf ee ugu horreysa fariinta waxaa loo qaybiyaa ereyo. Ereygu waa taxane xarfaha, lambarada iyo astaamaha _ . - / ah oo laga yaabo inuu ku bilowdo %. Xaraf kasta oo kale, sida meel bannaan, laba-dhibcood, hakad ama qaanso, wuxuu soo afjaraa ereyga. Gudaha <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> ereyadu waa <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> iyo <code>down</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "An identifier matches when it is <b>exactly equal to one whole word</b>, ignoring case. It is not a \"contains\", \"starts with\" or \"ends with\" search, and there are no wildcards: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> does not match the word <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, and <code>UPDOWN</code> does not match <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."
msgstr "Aqoonsigu wuu iswaafaqaa marka uu <b>si sax ah ula mid yahay hal eray oo dhammaystiran</b>, iyadoo aan loo eegin xarfaha waaweyn iyo kuwa yaryar. Ma aha raadin \"wuxuu ka kooban yahay\", \"wuxuu ku bilaabmaa\" ama \"wuxuu ku dhammaadaa\", mana jiraan wax calaamado duuban (wildcards) ah: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> lama mid aha erayga <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, sidoo kale <code>UPDOWN</code> lama mid aha <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A leading <b>%</b> is literal, not a wildcard, and must match the message word as written. An identifier <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> matches the message word <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, not <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; an identifier without the prefix matches only the unprefixed word."
msgstr "Horgalaha <b>%</b> waa mid dhab ah, ma aha astaan beddel ah, waana inuu u dhigmaa erayga farriinta sidii loo qoray. Aqoonsiga <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> wuxuu u dhigmaa erayga farriinta <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, ee ma aha <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; aqoonsi aan lahayn horgalaha wuxuu u dhigmaa oo keliya erayga aan horgalaha lahayn."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "When the syslog host is a Cacti device whose vendor is recognised from its SNMP system description or device template, and recommendations exist for that vendor, only that vendor's recommendations and those without a vendor are checked. Otherwise all vendors are checked, but an identifier made only of digits matches only recommendations without a vendor. When several recommendations match, the longest identifiers are shown first, up to three."
msgstr "Marka martigeliyaha syslog uu yahay Qalab Cacti ah oo iibiyihiisa laga aqoonsado sharraxaadda nidaamka SNMP ama qaab-dhismeedka qalabka, talooyinna ay u jiraan iibiyahaas, kaliya talooyinka iibiyahaas iyo kuwa aan lahayn iibiye ayaa la hubiyaa. Haddii kale dhammaan iibiyeyaasha waa la hubiyaa, laakiin aqoonsi ka kooban tirooyin keliya wuxuu u dhigmaa oo keliya talooyinka aan lahayn iibiye. Marka dhowr talo ay is waafaqaan, aqoonsiyada ugu dhaadheer ayaa marka hore la muujiyaa, ilaa saddex."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifiers that contain other characters, such as the <code>#</code> slot placeholder or the <code>|</code> alternatives in some vendor documentation (for example <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), are kept and exported but can never match. Set <b>Can Match</b> to No to list them, and edit them into the exact code, for example <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."
msgstr "Aqoonsiyada ka kooban xarfo kale, sida meel-buuxiyaha booska <code>#</code> ama kala-doorashooyinka <code>|</code> ee ku jira qoraallada iibiyaasha qaarkood (tusaale ahaan <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), waa la hayaa waana la dhoofiyaa laakiin marna ma is-waafaqi karaan. U deji <b>Wuu Is-waafaqi Karaa</b> Maya si aad u liis gareyso, oo wax uga beddesho koodka saxda ah, tusaale ahaan <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."

